{
  "1": {
    "episodeId": 1,
    "title": "The Escape",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0013585",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Nero was bored.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "He was also hungry.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "He saw Dr. Shady in the lab.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "She was his best—well, his only—friend.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "\"Can I have some Doggie Doodles?\" Nero asked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "\"No!\" Dr. Shady snapped.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "\"I'm busy working on my evil plan.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "Nero gasped. \"Your evil plan?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "The scientist smiled. \"I made you talk.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Next I'll make every dog talk.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "They'll tell their owners what to do.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "With your help, I'll take over the world!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Nero frowned. \"I won't help you do that.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "Dr. Shady laughed. \"You have to.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Why else would I keep you?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "\"Because we're best friends?\" Nero said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "\"Ha!\" Dr. Shady shook a test tube.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "\"I need a real friend,\" Nero thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "\"Somebody who's nice and feeds me Doggie Doodles.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Hmm . . .\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Nero grabbed a pair of Dr. Shady's shoes.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "\"Grr!\" He ripped them to shreds!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "\"Argh!\" Dr. Shady stamped her foot.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "\"Those were my favorite slippers!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Dr. Shady tossed Nero outside.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "Nero grinned. \"My plan worked!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "He ran to the fence and started digging.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "Dr. Shady grabbed his tail. \"I got you!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Nero kicked back hard. \"Oof!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "He squeezed under the fence and ran.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "Dr. Shady shook her fist. \"Get back here!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "Nero ran into town and hid.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "There was no sign of Dr. Shady.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p34",
        "text": "Nero curled up and fell asleep.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p35",
        "text": "When Nero woke up, he saw a friendly-looking boy.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p36",
        "text": "\"Hi! I'm Nero—can I live with you?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p37",
        "text": "I'm hiding from an evil scientist.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p38",
        "text": "The boy gasped. \"You talk ?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p39",
        "text": "\"Yes! And I'm starving,\" Nero said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p40",
        "text": "\"Do you have any Doggie Doodles?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p41",
        "text": "The boy scratched his head. \"I have carrots . . .\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p42",
        "text": "\"Good enough!\" Nero said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p43",
        "text": "\"I'm Dev,\" the boy said. \"But, um . . .",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p44",
        "text": "What was that about an evil scientist?\"",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "2": {
    "episodeId": 2,
    "title": "A Walk",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0013586",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "In Dev's kitchen Nero gobbled up carrots.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "He explained Dr. Shady's evil plan.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "Dev shook his head. \"Are you sure that's true?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "\"Yes! She made me talk,\" Nero said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "\"And she wants to make other dogs—\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "\"Dev?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "\"Who's that?\" Nero squeaked.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "\"My dad,\" Dev said. \"Follow me!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Dev pointed to a pile of stuffies on his bed.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "\"Hide under there!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "Nero grinned. \"Hide-and-seek!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "\"No, it's just hide !\" Dev said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "Nero slid under the stuffies.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "Dad came in. \"Who are you talking to?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "\"Er, nobody,\" Dev said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "Nero saw a big carrot. \"Yum!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "He tried to take a bite. \"Yuck! Too fuzzy!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "Dad yanked the stuffie away.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "\"Is that a real dog—and did he say 'fuzzy'?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "\"Oops!\" Nero thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Dev laughed nervously. \"I didn't hear anything.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "Dad frowned. \"Where's his owner?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "\"No, don't look for Dr. Shady!\" Nero thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "\"He's lost,\" Dev said quickly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "\"Please, can we keep him?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "Dad sighed. \"If we can't find his owner.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "Let's get a leash.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "At the pet shop, Dev slipped a harness on Nero.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Nero wiggled his butt. \"Looking good!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "Dev smiled and scratched Nero's ears.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "They walked to the park.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "\"Dev is nice,\" Nero thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "\"He scratches my ears and gives me treats.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p34",
        "text": "Just then the mayor walked by. \"What a cute dog!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p35",
        "text": "Nero grinned.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p36",
        "text": "Suddenly his eyes got big. \"Squirrel!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p37",
        "text": "Dad squinted. \"Did he just say 'squirrel'?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p38",
        "text": "\"No, he said, ' woof '!\" Dev said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p39",
        "text": "Nero slipped out of his harness and chased the squirrel.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p40",
        "text": "\"Stop!\" Dev and Dad chased Nero.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p41",
        "text": "Dev ran as fast as he could. \"Come back, Nero!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p42",
        "text": "\"No, come to me !\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p43",
        "text": "A woman jumped out of a bush.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p44",
        "text": "Nero gasped. \"Dr. Shady!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p45",
        "text": "Her eyes flashed red. \"I'm going to get you!\"",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "3": {
    "episodeId": 3,
    "title": "Big Chase",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0013587",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Nero dodged Dr. Shady.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Dev raced after Nero. \"That's Dr. Shady?",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "We have to lose her!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "\"No kidding!\" Nero said. \"She's right on our tails!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "Well, my tail anyway!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "They saw a merry-go-round.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "\"Let's hide on that merry-go-round!\" Dev said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "They jumped onto the ride.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Nero and Dev went round and round.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "They saw Dr. Shady looking for them!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "\"There you are!\" The scientist grabbed at Nero.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "\"Gotcha! Nope, missed! Gotcha! Nope . . .\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "She grabbed a bar and pulled herself up. \"I'm on!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "\"And we're off!\" Nero said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "He and Dev hopped onto a paddleboat.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "\"Hello!\" The mayor waved from another paddleboat.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "But then . . .",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "Nero gulped. \"Dr. Shady's coming! Pedal faster!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "\"Help me!\" Dev said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "\"My paws can't reach the pedals,\" Nero said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "Nero stuck his paws in the water and paddled.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "\"Ahh! Feels nice!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "He lapped up water. \"Tastes nice too!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "Dev scowled. \"Stop, Nero, you're tipping the—\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Splash! They fell in the lake.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "\"Swim to shore!\" Dev yelled.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "Dr. Shady pedaled toward them.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "\"You can't swim faster than my paddleboat!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Suddenly— crash!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "\"Hey, lady!\" the mayor yelled. \"You hit my paddleboat!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "On land, Dev and Nero raced down a hill.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "Nero tumbled and rolled. \"Whee!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "\"Oof!\" Dev tripped and rolled too.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p34",
        "text": "At the bottom of the hill, Nero panted. \"We lost her!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p35",
        "text": "Suddenly a hand gripped him.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p36",
        "text": "\"Nope!\" Dr. Shady said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p37",
        "text": "\"I'm right here. And you're coming with me.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p38",
        "text": "The mayor rushed over. \"Isn't that Dev's dog?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p39",
        "text": "Dr. Shady sneered. \"It's my dog.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p40",
        "text": "Nero gulped as she gripped him tighter.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p41",
        "text": "\"I saw Dev walking him earlier,\" the mayor said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p42",
        "text": "\"Yes!\" Dev nodded. \"He's my pet.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p43",
        "text": "Nero shook. \"Save me, Dev!\" he thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p44",
        "text": "\"Don't let her take me!\"",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "4": {
    "episodeId": 4,
    "title": "The Choice",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0013588",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Nero held his breath.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "The mayor looked from Dr. Shady to Dev.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "\"I'm going to let the dog choose.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "\"Huh?\" Dr. Shady said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "\"Huh?\" Dev said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "\"Huh? Um, woof?\" Nero said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "\"Follow me!\" The mayor took them to a field.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "\"Dev, stand there.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "He pointed to the opposite end. \"Miss, please stand there.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "Now both of you, call Nero.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "\"Nero!\" Dr. Shady yelled.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "\"Nero!\" Dev yelled.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "With his tail wagging, Nero ran toward Dev.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "\"I'm coming!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Then a familiar sound caught his ear. Crinkle! Crackle!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "Nero froze. \"Is that what I think it is?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "He sniffed the air. \"Doggie Doodles!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "Dr. Shady shook the bag. Crinkle! Crackle!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "\"Look, Nero! Doodles! Oodles of Doodles!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "Nero spun around—and bolted toward Dr. Shady!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "\"No, Nero!\" Dev yelled. \"Don't do it!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "\"Yes, Nero!\" Dr. Shady yelled. \"Do it!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "Nero tried to stop, but his feet kept going.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "\"Nero!\" Dev's eyes filled with tears. \"What about our friendship?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "Nero skidded to a stop.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "He thought of Dev's sunny kitchen.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "He thought of Dev's scratching his ears.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "Dr. Shady waved a Doodle. \"Nero, come!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Nero remembered the lonely science lab.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "He remembered the evil plan.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "Nero spun around and ran.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "He jumped on Dev. \"Best friends forever!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "\"Argh!\" Dr. Shady flung the Doodles to the ground.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p34",
        "text": "\"Nero is Dev's now,\" the mayor said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p35",
        "text": "\"Unless Nero changes his mind later.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p36",
        "text": "Dr. Shady stomped off. \"He's mine and I'll get him back!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p37",
        "text": "Dad appeared, huffing and puffing.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p38",
        "text": "\"Whew! That was some chase!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p39",
        "text": "Dev, I'm glad you caught Nero.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p40",
        "text": "I guess we have a new pet.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p41",
        "text": "Dev grinned. \"Ready to go home, Nero? Er, Nero?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p42",
        "text": "Chomp! Chomp! Chomp!",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p43",
        "text": "Nero looked up, his mouth stuffed with Doodles. \"Ready!\"",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  "5": {
    "episodeId": 5,
    "title": "Incredible Dog",
    "source": "official-text",
    "sourceId": "C0013589",
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "text": "Rain was pouring down.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "text": "Nero and Dev were inside, playing charades.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "text": "\"My turn!\" Nero hopped and rolled around the living room.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "text": "Dev tapped his chin. \"Are you a hot potato?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "text": "Nero's tail wagged. \"Yes!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "text": "Dev pumped his fist. \"Guessed it!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "text": "Dad stomped in, waving a slipper.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "text": "\"Someone chewed holes in this!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "text": "Nero gulped.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p10",
        "text": "\"And that's not all.\" Dad led them into the kitchen.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p11",
        "text": "Mud covered the floor.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p12",
        "text": "Nero hid his face with a paw.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p13",
        "text": "\"Oh, um, that was me,\" Dev said quickly.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p14",
        "text": "Dad pointed to the prints. \"Do you have paws, Dev?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p15",
        "text": "Dev sighed. \"No.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p16",
        "text": "\"Someone was also eating the trash again,\" Dad said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p17",
        "text": "Nero burped.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p18",
        "text": "Dad turned to Dev. \"Nero needs training.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p19",
        "text": "He's going to a class at Pam's K9 Academy.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p20",
        "text": "\"Dog school!\" Nero thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p21",
        "text": "\"Dev has to sit at a desk all day at school . . .",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p22",
        "text": "I can't do that!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p23",
        "text": "\"But Nero is already trained,\" Dev said. \"Watch this!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p24",
        "text": "Dev looked at Nero. \"Sit!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p25",
        "text": "\"Easy-peasy!\" Nero thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p26",
        "text": "He lowered his back end to the floor.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p27",
        "text": "But then a bird shot past the window.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p28",
        "text": "Nero charged over. \"Woof! Woof!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p29",
        "text": "Dad frowned and folded his arms.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p30",
        "text": "Dev sighed. \"Fine. I'll take Nero to school.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p31",
        "text": "Pam's K9 Academy had a big yard.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p32",
        "text": "It also had lots of toys.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p33",
        "text": "\"This doesn't look too bad,\" Nero thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p34",
        "text": "Just then a disk flew past them.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p35",
        "text": "A big dog jumped up and caught the disk.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p36",
        "text": "\"Cool!\" Dev said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p37",
        "text": "\"Fun!\" Nero thought.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p38",
        "text": "Next the big dog zoomed off on a skateboard.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p39",
        "text": "Dev's eyes lit up. \"He's amazing!\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p40",
        "text": "\"Hmpf!\" Nero said. \"He's not that amazing.\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p41",
        "text": "The big dog did more tricks.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p42",
        "text": "\"That dog is incredible!\" Dev said.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p43",
        "text": "Nero rolled his eyes. \"I bet he can't . . . Dev?\"",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p44",
        "text": "Nero gasped.",
        "translation": ""
      },
      {
        "id": "p45",
        "text": "Dev was petting the dog!",
        "translation": ""
      }
    ]
  }
}
